-list-item\\\"> The Pilot FriXion Fineliner marker is suitable for all daily, school, and creative uses; writing, coloring, drawing, organizing a diary, whatever it is, unleash your creativity, and erase what you don't like </span></li> <li class=\\\"a-spacing-mini\\\"><span class=\\\"a-list-item\\\"> The pen's durable eraser cap raises the temperature of the ink on paper to completely eliminate it; that's why we do not recommend the use of this erasable marker on official documents </span></li> <li class=\\\"a-spacing-mini\\\"><span class=\\\"a-list-item\\\"> Quick and effortless erasable ink: erase a word, line, or paragraph and rewrite it immediately; Clearer writing without draft marks, cleaner work, and significant time optimization </span></li> </ul> <div data-csa-c-content-id=\\\"voyager-product-details-jumplink\\\" data-csa-c-slot-id=\\\"voyager-product-details-jumplink\\\" data-csa-c-type=\\\"link\\\" class=\\\"a-section\\\"> <span class=\\\"caretnext\\\">›</span> <a id=\\\"seeMoreDetailsLink\\\" class=\\\"a-link-normal\\\" href=\\\"#productDetails\\\"> See more product details </a> </div> </div> </div> <div id=\\\"sustZoneATF_feature_div\\\" class=\\\"celwidget\\\" data-feature-name=\\\"sustZoneATF\\\" data-csa-c-type=\\\"widget\\\" data-csa-c-content-id=\\\"sustZoneATF\\\" data-csa-c-slot-id=\\\"sustZoneATF_feature_div\\\" data-csa-c-asin=\\\"B07SLY4NMK\\\" data-csa-c-is-in-initial-active-row=\\\"false\\\" data-cel-widget=\\\"sustZoneATF_feature_div\\\"> </div> <div id=\\\"provenanceCertifications_feature_div\\\" class=\\\"celwidget\\\" data-feature-name=\\\"provenanceCertifications\\\" data-csa-c-type=\\\"widget\\\" data-csa-c-content-id=\\\"provenanceCertifications\\\" data-csa-c-slot-id=\\\"provenanceCertifications_feature_div\\\" data-csa-c-asin=\\\"B07SLY4NMK\\\" data-csa-c-is-in-initial-active-row=\\\"false\\\" data-cel-widget=\\\"provenanceCertifications_feature_div\\\"> </div> <div id=\\\"handmadeArtisanCard_feature_div\\\" class=\\\"celwidget\\\"